{"branch":"야탑점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">야탑점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-caf1d4258f53135d.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"야탑점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-caf1d4258f53135d.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>경기 성남시 중원구 양현로 461 4층 402호</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><ul class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수인분당</span><span>야탑역</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>여수동입구</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>장미마을8단지.현대아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>연꽃마을4단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>야탑중학교</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>매화마을1단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>연꽃마을4단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">7</span><span>연꽃마을4단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">8</span><span>여수초등학교</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">9</span><span>장미마을8단지.매화마을주공1단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">10</span><span>여수초등학교</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">11</span><span>야탑중학교</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">12</span><span>연꽃마을4단지정문</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">13</span><span>센트럴타운3단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">14</span><span>야탑119안전센터</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">마을</span></dt><dd><span>